Package: ckdata
Title: Query the CourseKata Data Lake
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Adam", "Blake", email = "adam@ablake.dev", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("CourseKata", role = "cph")
  )
Description: A read-only DBI and dbplyr interface to the CourseKata data lake.
    A shared Rust core executes Athena queries through Parquet and returns
    Arrow results, including schemas for empty results. Researchers can use
    lazy dplyr queries, SQL, and explicit local result caching.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/coursekata/ckdata
BugReports: https://github.com/coursekata/ckdata/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
